Agar **`list-style: none;`** use karte hain, toh list ke **bullets (•) ya numbering (1, 2, 3, etc.)** hat jaate hain. Yeh mostly navigation menus aur custom-styled lists me use hota hai.  

### Example:
```css
ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}
```
👉 Yeh CSS unordered (`<ul>`) list ke **default bullets hata dega**.  
👉 Saath me `padding` aur `margin` hataane se list left se properly align ho jaayegi.  

Agar custom icons ya styling chahiye, toh hum **`list-style-image`** ya **CSS icons** use kar sakte hain. 😊
